PARITY (web components/ai/ConfirmDialog.tsx → native)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  • Modal(title "Approve Helix action")          → TSGlassPanel + TSFadeIn panel, header title
  • intro = tool.mutates ? mutates : read        → AiConfirmDialogProjection.introDescriptor(mutates:)
  • Tool label + tool.name (mono) + description?  → AiConfirmDialogToolSection (monospaced name)
  • Arguments label + JSON.stringify(args ?? {},2)→ AiConfirmArgsFormatter.pretty (2-space, sorted,
                                                    unescaped slashes; verbatim non-JSON; "{}" empty)
  • Cancel (secondary) / Approve (primary,loading)→ AiConfirmDialogActions (TSButton .secondary / .primary)
  • loading prop → both disabled + Approve spinner → model.isBusy (request.loading || submitting)
  • onClose = loading ? noop : onCancel            → model.dismiss() (swallowed while busy)
  States added for the P4 matrix (never a blank box): loading / empty / error+retry / stale chip +
  one-shot auto-refresh / offline cached banner. i18n: all 7 web keys present; no English literals
  in Swift (P1/S10 facade). a11y: VoiceOver labels on panel/tool/args/buttons/close/chip; Dynamic
  Type via Font.TS; reduce-motion via TSFadeIn. Telemetry: view.opened slug "AiConfirmDialog".

